  "details": "I think the new nameplates are just ugly and boring but I do understand why other people like them. So I think a good compromise is to have the ability to switch between them in settings. I understand it may just sound like I'm complaining because I don't like change but thats not it at all, I would be willing to accept new nameplates if they just looked better, they should have some color to them and preferably be translucent so you can see whats behind them. They don't need to be huge like the old ones were or anything, I actually kind of like the smaller look, I really just think they should have some color to them at least.",
